sequenceDiagram
    title GET /api/Roles
    actor User as User
    participant UI as GetListRolesUI
    participant Endpoint as :RolesController
    participant Service as :RoleService
    participant DB as :UnitOfWork
    participant Database as :Database

    User->>UI: 1.1 Yêu cầu hiển thị danh sách vai trò
    activate UI
    UI->>Endpoint: 2.1 GET /api/Roles (pageNumber, pageSize)
    activate Endpoint

    Endpoint->>Service: 3.1 GetListRoleAsync(pageNumber, pageSize)
    activate Service

    Service->>DB: 3.2 RoleRepository.GetPagedAsync(pageNumber, pageSize, r => r.IsActive && !r.IsDeleted)
    activate DB
    DB->>Database: 3.3 Execute SELECT query with pagination
    activate Database
    Database-->>DB: 3.4 Paged list of Roles
    deactivate Database
    deactivate DB

    Service-->>Endpoint: 3.5 PagedResponse of RoleResponse
    deactivate Service
    Endpoint-->>UI: 3.6 200 OK (PagedResponse of RoleResponse)
    deactivate Endpoint
    deactivate UI
